## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design CKNE-aware, policy-driven enforcement in a multi-tenant setting with privacy constraints.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE maps to latency budgets, sampling rates, and audit retention
- Minute-by-minute degradation loop with fair reallocation
- Payload shape and telemetry for validation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: compute quotas based on CKNE
function quotasByCKNE(ckne) {
  const base = 100;
  const latencyBudget = base * (1 - ckne);
  const maskingRate = 1 - 0.8 * ckne;
  const retentionDays = Math.max(1, 7 - Math.floor(6 * ckne));
  return { latencyBudget, maskingRate, retentionDays };
}
```

